{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jxhw7wUhSMEZLqyk_1avyA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:00.296426+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jxhw7wUhSMEZLqyk_1avyA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/f2icT52ibnRFBkXtNqZsy7bnGLmETeGFwbnCxpv3JhiaHRicPsF3RkvAoXqXjb7lB0n7oTBk72wDNvK2jgFXSyDv7IExkN5KRKYswBIhRh50huQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>·2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动·</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>为了增进全国相关专业优秀本科生对我院各学科（领域）专业的了解，激发科研兴趣，拓展学术视野，搭建广大师生之间学术交流平台，我院定于</span><strong><span>2026年7月15日</span></strong><span>组织开展暑期夏令营活动。现就有关事宜通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>暑期夏令营活动面向全国高校优秀本科三年级在校生</span><strong><span>（2027年应届本科毕业生）</span></strong><span>。报名对象须满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，具有坚定正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，遵纪守法，品德端正，积极向上，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2、勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀，无不及格科目；学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和培养潜质；</span></p><p><span>3、诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p><p><span>4、品行优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>5、有意向报考我院2027年硕士研究生的优秀本科生。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生类型</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、学术型硕士：计算机科学与技术、低空技术与工程；</span></p><p><span>2、专业型硕士：电子信息、农业工程与信息技术。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请材料及流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、申请学生须填写《信息学院（人工智能学院）夏令营报名表》（签字应为手写签，PDF扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>2、报名截止时的最新成绩单及专业排名证明材料（成绩单需加盖教务或学院公章，PDF扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>3、身份证扫描件（正反面扫描在一张纸上）和学生证扫描件（PDF扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>4、申请表上填写的相关成果证明材料（如已发表论文的复印件、各类证书等）（PDF扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>5、将</span><span><strong><span>上述4项材料放入一个文件夹中</span></strong></span><span>，将整个文件夹压缩后发送至学院联系邮箱，压缩包和邮件主题均命名为“2026年夏令营+本科院校名+报名专业+姓名”。</span><strong><span><span>注意2、3、4项材料整理到同一个PDF中</span></span></strong><span>。</span><span><strong><span>同时，务必填写报名信息问卷：</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/tEmFMRF.aspx </span></span></strong></p><p><span>6、报名截止时间为：</span><strong><span>2026年7月12日中午12:00</span></strong><span>，逾期报名（以收到邮件时间为准）或附件不符合要求视为报名无效。</span></p><p><span>7、学院将会对报名者的资格进行审核，审核通过获得营员资格者，学院将于</span><strong><span>7月14日前通过邮件形式通知</span></strong><span>，未收到通知者即未获得营员资格。请申请者密切关注自己的邮件，并及时回复参营回执。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、夏令营主要内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营将采用</span><span><strong><span>线上方式</span></strong></span><span>开展：</span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>日期</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>时间</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>主要内容</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月15日</span><span><br/></span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>9:00-11:30</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学院介绍、学科专业介绍</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7月15日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>14:00-16:00</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>学院科研巡展</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、相关说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、申请人必须确保提供的信息和材料完整、真实、准确，若在申请过程中存在弄虚作假或其他违规舞弊行为，一经发现即取消其申请资格，并通报申请人所在院校。</span></p><p><span>2、若本通知与上级单位或学校发布的有关规定不符，按上级单位和学校发布的新规定执行。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aHMibACo1vWvv96ib0lFRE4RXJWM4HiajvvicicAjGEg4I3XKeydSdW9PZ6qyB7wCyibDFXtqW9Qib2s7bCGaHF4KibGVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>◆联系人：徐老师</span></p><p><span>◆联系邮箱：xinxiyanzhao@yeah.net</span></p><p><span>◆沟通群二维码：（</span><span>所有通过资格审查的同学务必扫码进<span>钉钉群</span></span><span>）</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/f2icT52ibnRFA95eMSBfKGFUA3UIj69sm5Z0ugN3KKwmHy7ZtNXkpVuvfE1oiagXYw8tqbxqjiagTwpELAPqa9qAz1fBrqLkfqWI6u3yEulE84I/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>北京林业大学信息学院（人工智能学院）</span></p><p><span>2026年7月10日                </span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0H1Xs6hpNU1icfJ7x50BUIwmw5VYP1YnaVIvtAdMibATibuicsGTuhKoE2JwqDLzhK6iaIWkMTiarRMfkPg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>附件详见<span>“阅读原文”</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>信息学院（人工智能学院）2026年优秀大学生夏令营申请表.docx</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>推荐阅读</span></strong></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTE2MzgwNw==&amp;mid=2651944630&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=9187a0e03818be723415495eafb72ec5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/f2icT52ibnRFDLbxyyw3gbVZMILyiaictAQUDapFZxjia5XjjyvObqNicMfKPkXreR0yFaokGpcNqg4ib3smUZTRm6t4GX46L5jJan06lG1lunSZvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTE2MzgwNw==&amp;mid=2651944630&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=9187a0e03818be723415495eafb72ec5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数智筑防｜每周一案（第14期）：快递理赔藏陷阱，信息泄露失钱财</a></span></p></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTE2MzgwNw==&amp;mid=2651944610&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=c2a1d4367e0d23a800b3